6", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623400_1336662814853839_8575896276767822033_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iTvS88xd2MwQ7kNvwGBRsOp&_nc_oc=AdpvERm5xxFblmCq39ZSZwqUvU75vNSADU606kMLe0vWw84lCs-ACrbbKXa49P2Ak1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCScenwn-IvCjxHi4yyY6-JA8GAJsf0L_KfJ3qyjPWRQ&oe=6AB6843D"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "2230572054152344", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_2230572057485677_2372904277471757210_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g2TGeygDokgQ7kNvwEBw3xS&_nc_oc=AdrykytpPo-EiN7HDiilLqHlGYxP66qQPKlebp9Gub6cOViJQEp_vbAzFYKSBJcMXnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJPmEeq-hluyk6dxpqHbHr0W7PKuEvJ5lisNVGh-UsJ8w&oe=6AB6904A"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1371269948213119", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619808_1371269951546452_7889463761728838125_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gU4x5v6oHxcQ7kNvwFs7p3T&_nc_oc=AdpSDQT43HmX441T17OeEmpiqKprCNq093jqFCAGrE9cv8Nau1rAqRkvjSFIoLvp7CE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIOfAuXYM3aaMv28ar_FpLNYs_MSLGZbEFVfqvC4bg11A&oe=6AB68505"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2053251158890666", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620666_2053251165557332_3639408551821098942_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yJ2WRfCLM8wQ7kNvwGx_3yl&_nc_oc=Ado3QR9yRQYvJ70Pb7EIPpZg5UvHVzQpvah5WjkY7IBtlzrDniM7MgN39kHi9GNUVYc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRnCxsM4LdHXejfBCAKnXaFVhl0LUylXhGp7uhHDF5bg&oe=6AB6893D"}, "display_name": "Fit Squat XR: Lower Body Workout", "keywords": ["Fitness", "Rhythm", "Cardio", "Exercise", "Training"], "long_description": "# Turn Squats into an Energizing Rhythm Game! \u26a1    \u3000\n\nBored of standard workouts? **Fit Squat XR** transforms a powerful lower-body workout into an exhilarating rhythm challenge. Sync your movement to the music, dodge obstacles, and build strength while enjoying the game.    \n\n# \ud83d\udd25 Key Features\n\n* **\ud83c\udfb5 Rhythm-Driven Workout**\n\n Move to the beat! Walls rush toward you in time with the music, turning intense leg exercise into pure gameplay.  \n* **\ud83d\udcaa Scale Your Challenge**\n\nFind your perfect pace with **EASY**, **NORMAL**, or **HARD** modes. Crank it up to HARD for rapid squat sequences that will truly test your legs and glutes.    \n* **\ud83d\udcc8 Calorie Tracking**\n\nKeep track of your energy burned after every session. Your progress is personal, rewarding, and visible.   \n* **\ud83d\ude4c Controller-Free Freedom**\n\nExperience the ultimate comfort with Hand Tracking. Ditch the controllers and move naturally with your hands completely free. \n* **\ud83c\udfe0 Turn Your Room into a Gym (MR Mode)**\n\nWith Mixed Reality, rhythmic neon walls stream directly into your living space! Stay aware of your real-world surroundings while you move. \n\n\n\n> **Ready to move? Squat to the beat and crush your fitness goals today! \ud83c\udfc6**", "short_description": "Drop low, feel the beat, and break a sweat! \ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Fit Squat XR is your immersive VR rhythm fitness arena where your lower body takes center stage. Dodge incoming walls in time with high-energy tracks. Challenge your legs with multiple difficulty levels and feel the rhythm. Your next leg workout starts now! \ud83c\udfc6  \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/product/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "8